### Allocate workers with standard configuration
POST http://localhost:8080/orch/api/workers/allocate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "worker_count": 5,
  "task_timeout_secs": 300,
  "max_retry_attempts": 3
}

### Allocate single worker
POST http://localhost:8080/orch/api/workers/allocate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "worker_count": 1,
  "task_timeout_secs": 180,
  "max_retry_attempts": 2
}

### Allocate workers for high performance
POST http://localhost:8080/orch/api/workers/allocate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "worker_count": 10,
  "task_timeout_secs": 600,
  "max_retry_attempts": 5
}

